<title>HONG KONG: Trade in First Shanghai shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in First Shanghai shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of financial services concern First Shanghai Investments Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>First Shanghai shares fell HK$0.12 to HK$1.81 on Tuesday on volume of 41.65 million shares.</p>
<p>Last month, the company said its controlling shareholder, International Enterprises Investment Co Ltd, had proposed the issuance of share options to subscribe First Shanghai shares, which -- if implemented -- would dilute shareholders' interest in the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
